{"v":4,"catch":"KI在等待救贖的騎士……","desc":"《THE TOWER OF DRUAGA》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1984 年發行的動作 RPG 遊戲。\n在DRUAGA控制的巨塔的每一層隱藏各種物品的同時，一個接一個地上樓，解救被困在頂層的愛人KI。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-06-02","genres":["動作","角色扮演","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4ec15d84cc8a5c3cc21b677300ca2609a78a2e7ca2a0dd911093a68f0033dd0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3fc8f80ae4677a56725da3099fa864e2efebcf55571bba99b710a996743ceeda.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3686eb592f75f1d7ee5b8cc8f15a915c87c41fef481a38df6009099e6873c846.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f286986f71581fe588687876f343fe49c39eb2c0815ea5659552cba4335a8fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8c9a168c8eb08c43ddd288d5f2ff9402fe60f4a595d62676ce52921f93e2b58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c0470b29a7c09398963d954dbbd8a4580fe79b1c2897bee18506bd45e18d24c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c32017482000","dlc":[]}